# Agent worktrees are scratch: created and destroyed per run, and eight of them
# were committed once as bare gitlinks by a parallel session. Clones cannot
# fetch them, they turn up as phantom deletions in every status, and a stray
# 'git add -A' sweeps them straight back in.
.claude/worktrees/
